---
title: Architecture Diagram Maintenance
---
flowchart TB
    Maintainer([Maintainer]) --> Request[Change request<br/>and explicit source evidence]
    Request --> Guards{Local model, safe paths,<br/>bounded context?}
    Guards -->|no| Reject[Reject request]
    Guards -->|yes| Agent[DiagramAgent]
    Agent --> Gemma[Gemma 4 12B<br/>candidate call]
    Gemma --> Validate{Valid passive Mermaid<br/>with required labels?}
    Validate -->|one correction| Agent
    Validate -->|no| Reject
    Validate -->|yes| Candidate[(New candidate<br/>Mermaid and SVG)]
    Candidate --> Review{Technical and<br/>visual review}
    Review -->|reject| Request
    Review -->|approve| Canonical[(Manual canonical<br/>source and SVG update)]

    Protection[No remote model and no<br/>automatic canonical overwrite]
    Guards -.-> Protection
    Review -.-> Protection

    classDef interface fill:#f5f5f7,stroke:#86868b,color:#1d1d1f;
    classDef application fill:#e8f1fb,stroke:#5e8fc4,color:#102a43;
    classDef data fill:#eef7ee,stroke:#5f9562,color:#183b1b;
    classDef external fill:#f1edff,stroke:#8872c6,color:#2e2450;
    classDef warning fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#b78b20,color:#4d3900,stroke-dasharray:5 4;
    class Maintainer,Request interface;
    class Guards,Agent,Validate,Review application;
    class Candidate,Canonical data;
    class Gemma external;
    class Reject,Protection warning;
